  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      63.36,
      429.36,
      303.51,
      499.43
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 thatGovernment intends to acquire the following land which isrequired for resettlement of persons displaced by landslidesin 2016 in Bulathkohupitiya Divisional Secretary's Division.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      63.36,
      509.76,
      232.66,
      519.83
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      63.36,
      532.56,
      303.54,
      614.63
    ],
    "text": "Three allotments of land called Urumeewala Estate, WagollaDivision depicted in the preliminary plan No. P. P. K/3569prepared by the Superintendent of Survey, Kegalle situated inthe village of Wegalla in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 128B Wegalla in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofBulathkohupitiya in the District of Kegalle in SabaragamuwaProvince.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      63.36,
      628.56,
      303.24,
      662.63
    ],
    "text": "Date of examination for claims for compensation :- On 13thMarch, 2018 at 10.00 a.m for allotments No. 1 to 3 of P. P. K.3569.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      63.36,
      676.56,
      303.41,
      698.63
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby requiredto appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      315.36,
      322.56,
      555.5,
      344.63
    ],
    "text": "before me at Bulathkohupitiya Divisional Secretariat on theaforesaid date and time.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      315.36,
      354.72,
      555.37,
      410.87
    ],
    "text": "Further, you are hereby requested to notify to me in writing(in duplicate) on or before 10.03.2018, the nature of theirinterests in the land, the particulars of their claims forcompensation for the acquisition of the said land the amountof compensation and details of computation of such amount.",
